WEBVTT

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:40.410
Brother, what's this?

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:03.850
Until the cherry tree blossoms.

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:09.900
I understand.

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:43.260
What is a joukan?

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:44.890
Is it something bad?

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:47.890
A joukan is a rank in name only.

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:50.350
It means an officer who has no function.

00:02:56.530 --> 00:03:00.990
Well then, I might as well do what I can until my suspension is over.

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:24.720
Tei Yuushun,

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:27.100
in consideration of your achievements in Sashuu,

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:30.060
I order you to undertake the office of minister in the cabinet,

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:32.060
and hereby name you Prime Minister.

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:33.020
What do you say?

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:35.860
Only if you will accept my conditions.

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:39.570
Your conditions?

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:40.820
Yes.

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:46.120
One, when ruling the people, place the highest importance on charity and righteousness.

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:49.620
Two, refrain from unnecessary wars.

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:54.630
Three, do not promote a person to a higher official rank based on his blood.

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:58.880
Four, do not create new official positions to suit your convenience.

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:03.880
Five, severely punish those who take advantage of Your Highness' authority.

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:07.010
Six, eliminate all possible means of bribery.

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:12.390
Seven, do not build unnecessary temples and Imperial villas with tax money.

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:16.360
Eight, ensure that nobles and subjects alike know how to conduct themselves,

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:18.900
and in turn, Your Highness must treat his subjects with the utmost courtesy.

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:22.570
Nine, broaden the opportunities to remonstrate with the Emperor.

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:27.740
Ten, when Your Highness marries, your wife's family will probably attempt to exert political influence.

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:31.160
Do not allow this to happen.

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:40.800
If you will accept these ten conditions, I shall obey the order to become Prime Minister with gratitude in my heart.

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:45.550
Yuushun has done it.

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:47.340
He is spoiling the Emperor.

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:50.930
He does not need to take that greenhorn under his wing.

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:53.810
Because nobody had done it, Yuushun did.

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:57.810
It is a coup that Ri Kouyuu and Ran Shuuei cannot copy.

00:04:58.310 --> 00:05:02.820
The nobles' distaste for the young Emperor is rising beneath the surface.

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:08.570
However, with these ten terms, Yuushun has substituted his will for that of the Emperor.

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:13.580
The force of all opposition will now be aimed at Yuushun instead of the Emperor.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:18.170
In exchange for the Emperor's promise, he has sworn an unbreakable oath.

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:23.170
Ryuuki was always alone, but he has finally obtained a shield.

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:29.260
I thought the Emperor always stood alone, but...

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:33.640
I promise.

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:45.860
I humbly obey your order, Your Highness,

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:51.950
to be a minister in the cabinet, henceforth the Prime Minister.

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:59.000
Oh, Kochou, you just woke up?

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:04.840
I strained my eyes last night during the meeting of the mafia chiefs.

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:09.090
That kept me awake, and I couldn't sleep.

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:11.140
Your eyes? At the meeting?

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:12.220
That's right.

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:16.640
Anyway, old master, you were talking about selling a painting,

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:21.810
but rather than selling, it looks like you bought something instead?

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:27.530
No, I did sell the painting like I said,
but I bought another in spite of myself.

00:06:27.850 --> 00:06:31.160
It's painted by an obscure new painter, but I'm sure he'll become famous.

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:33.910
What's his pseudonym?

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:35.870
There's no signature.

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:38.660
But I don't mind if there isn't.

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:43.670
As usual, after I enjoy it for myself for a few days, I'll display it in the store.

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:45.210
Look forward to it.

00:07:01.960 --> 00:07:03.270
Oh, Father.

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:04.610
You received a letter.

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:07.530
It's from Kochou-nee-san.

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:13.320
What does it say?

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:17.290
She says that I should come by, because there's someone she wants me to meet.

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:20.580
Well then, apparently you'll be going out today too.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:21.290
Yes.

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:23.960
Excuse me!

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:30.470
These are the ones.

00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:35.640
Rin, can you control as much information as possible through the Merchants Guild?

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:37.470
I'll manage somehow.

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:43.100
Then Rin, I'm sorry, but please excuse yourself at this point.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:44.230
All right.

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:56.910
Now everyone, please keep this information confidential.

00:07:57.490 --> 00:08:01.000
The Ministry of Justice seems to have already begun investigating this,

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:02.910
so for now, let's see what happens.

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:04.670
The Ministry of Justice?

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:07.170
Have you got a plan?

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:11.920
Let's see. It's been four years since Your Highness' enthronement.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:16.680
How about commissioning a famous painter to do your portrait?

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:18.100
A portrait?

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:20.930
Yuushun-dono, why do that now?

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:28.440
Well, according to classified information my wife Rin has obtained, Heki Yuukoku is visiting Kiyou.

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:32.070
The painter who is considered a genius born once in a thousand years?

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:36.490
I think I'm also a gifted person born once in a thousand years, but...

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:38.030
a portrait?

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:41.540
I see!

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:42.540
Clever thinking.

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:44.210
It's a good opportunity.

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:46.830
Let's find him and ask him to work for us.

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:53.420
Yes, I happen to be in the prime of life, and of course it's a commission for a portrait,

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:57.970
but perhaps every now and then, Yuukoku-dono wants to do something other than painting.

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:04.430
He's good at more things than just painting, though his versatility is not well known.

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:10.150
Nonetheless, I hear Heki Yuukoku never stays in one place and wanders around from place to place.

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:14.240
I'll command my men to gather
information confidentially and quickly.

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:19.450
There are people from the Heki family in the Department of Human Resources.

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:21.700
I'll ask if they know anything about him.

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:26.960
We need to commission him by any means, before the price of housewares rises.

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:35.340
I cannot answer any questions related to Heki Yuukoku.

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:36.010
What?

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:39.390
Consider this the collective opinion of the Heki family.

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:42.810
The Heki family is a family with talents in the arts.

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:46.350
Because of its talents, the family has been used by the Emperor and other families countless times.

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:50.670
The number of those who resisted and died
maintaining their principles is not insignificant.

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:54.030
We don't want to lose any more people.

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:59.700
Heki Yuukoku is the greatest treasure of this era, and the Heki family must protect him.

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:05.620
In particular, Yuukoku is likely to be
appointed as the next head of the family.

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:08.750
That's why the Heki family is being particularly protective of him.

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:12.380
I see. In that case, I won't ask anymore.

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:16.300
Fortunately, Yuukoku-dono is staying near Kiyou right now.

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:19.090
We'll manage by ourselves from here on.

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:20.300
He's in Kiyou?

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:21.760
So I've heard.

00:10:27.680 --> 00:10:33.770
Well then, we will reserve the appointment of the
successor to Chief Kan Rinin. Are we agreed?

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:36.230
Those are all the matters to be discussed toda-

00:10:36.230 --> 00:10:38.280
Aiyah! Please wait a moment!

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:42.780
I said please wait a moment.

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:44.780
Both his names are Uu.

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:47.200
He's Uu-dono, the Vice Minister of Sentou shrine.

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:50.670
The most important duty of the Sentou minister would be...

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:54.920
There's still the matter of Ryuuki-sama's marriage!

00:10:58.340 --> 00:10:59.590
Y-Your Highness!

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:02.470
Please wait! Your Highness!

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:06.510
Prime Minister Tei.

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:07.720
Yes?

00:11:07.720 --> 00:11:11.730
About those ten conditions you proposed to His Highness...

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:14.400
I've forgotten something!

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:19.650
The bride!

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:22.450
I am not pleased.

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:25.830
Ouki-dono, did you say something?

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:32.670
In the reign of the previous Emperor, numerous noble families were exterminated or ruined.

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:37.710
In the house of lords, there are nobles who experienced misfortunes in great quantity.

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:44.220
The seven families and the Hyou family have been treated much more favorably than other families, don't you think?

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:49.220
I was hoping His Highness would be different from the previous Emperor,

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:51.230
but in the few years since his enthronement,

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:55.060
a number of policies, such as allowing women in the
national exam and appointing new Sashuu governors,

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:57.230
have been promulgated without our consent.

00:11:57.230 --> 00:12:00.320
His Highness can use Tei Yuushun as a shield to avoid us,

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:06.240
but I, the leader of the house of lords, the stronghold of the nobles, will not forget this.

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:15.330
Even so, don't you think the nobles have been given great privileges compared to the commoners?

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:17.380
That is as things should be.

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:23.300
If we do not make class distinctions obvious to everyone, we cannot force the people to obey.

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:35.980
Honestly, I am not pleased.

00:12:56.790 --> 00:12:58.040
My son,

00:12:58.620 --> 00:13:01.170
if you're not busy, I'd like you to do me a favor.

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:02.670
Do you a favor?

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:09.140
In plain terms, you should hoodwink a girl and marry her, apparently.

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:10.510
What do you mean, "apparently"?

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:13.720
Did that request come from a higher official, Dad?

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:14.850
Yeah.

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:18.440
All right, so, who's the girl?

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:20.730
She's super high class, the airiest of the nobility.

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:23.190
She's a girl from the Kou family of all families.

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:31.450
You mean Kou Shuurei?

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:33.580
Spot on!

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:35.080
Absolutely not!

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:37.170
A woman who dashes into the kind of life

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:43.390
where sudden twists and turns occur every moment, until you think, "Is she cursed?"

00:13:43.390 --> 00:13:44.330
Not even for a laugh.

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:48.720
Yeah, but we'll get a better title, and of all things, we'll get a lot of money!

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:55.140
So, in exchange for money and a title, you sold my marriage to some higher official?

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:59.060
That's right, so go and take your best shot at proposing to her.

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:04.070
Unless you obtain some kind of contract with her, I won't let you back in the house.

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:05.490
Is this for real?

00:14:05.490 --> 00:14:06.820
I can't be bothered...

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:11.820
By the way, Dad, how come you've started to take an interest in this sort of "fine art"?

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:17.750
I thought I'd deepen my knowledge, as
preparation for getting a better title.

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:27.420
Hello, handsome fellow over there.

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:31.850
Hey, hottie!

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:35.350
I've got some things just for you.

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:38.100
Yeah, but I've gotta take my best shot at proposing to a girl-

00:14:38.110 --> 00:14:39.940
There! It's fate!

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:44.230
I have something exactly right for a hottie like you who's about to propose.

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:45.230
Right here.

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:51.070
Not bad...

00:14:58.660 --> 00:14:59.910
The price of salt has risen.

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:01.620
The quality of pots and pans has declined a bit.

00:15:01.620 --> 00:15:04.710
Someone in the neighborhood fell into debt and did a moonlight flit.

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:06.710
What's all this about?

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:10.970
Hey, you aren't an agony aunt, are you?

00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:12.890
Santa, don't say that.

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:15.180
When will you call me Keichou?

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:19.770
But to me, you're still my childhood friend Santa.

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:21.480
A childhood friend...

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:24.980
To begin with, aren't you suspended right now?

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:26.400
Why are you doing this?

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:29.900
Right now, I just want to do what I can, as much as I can.

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:35.070
Anyway, didn't you have business with me?

00:15:35.070 --> 00:15:36.870
Um, well, this!

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:42.290
My uncle bought this from somewhere.

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:44.630
But it'd be bad if he's been overcharged for it,

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:47.960
so I was wondering if you'd introduce me to someone who could give an expert opinion.

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:49.800
Good timing!

00:15:50.210 --> 00:15:53.510
I'm going to see Kochou-nee-san today, so I'll ask her to take a look.

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:57.390
Kochou-nee-san is Kiyou's top connoisseur, so there'll be no mistake!

00:15:58.060 --> 00:15:58.770
I'll contac-

00:15:58.770 --> 00:15:59.890
W-W-Wait a second.

00:16:00.220 --> 00:16:00.810
What?

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:06.560
This was just in passing, like an excuse.

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:08.570
I actually had something I wanted to tell you.

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:10.190
Tell me? About what?

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:15.870
Well, you and I turned 18 this year, right?

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:18.990
True, we were 17 last year.

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:20.240
Don't make a joke of it.

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:22.960
And so, I...

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:24.370
I'm here to...

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:28.460
So...

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:35.260
I came to propose to you!

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:35.680
Huh?

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:38.080
I'm not planning to do anything-

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:40.010
Argh! I missed the important bit!

00:16:40.010 --> 00:16:43.230
I meant a proposal, not seasons greetings!

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:45.810
In that case, you write P.S.

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:49.690
Argh! No! By propose, I mean...

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:53.360
Never mind.

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:56.160
I'll go with you to Kochou-san's place.

00:16:57.280 --> 00:16:57.740
Huh?

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:00.700
Was that cherry tree here before?

00:17:01.240 --> 00:17:03.450
I received it two years ago.

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:05.330
That's why it's still quite small.

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:07.750
Oh, then it's not going to bloom this year.

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:09.210
Actually there are buds.

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:12.840
When it blooms...

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:15.300
When it blooms?

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:18.890
I-It would be nice to have a party under the cherry blossoms, right?

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:20.430
Anyway, let's go.

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:25.480
Hey Santa, haven't you lost a bit of weight?

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:26.520
You... You're Kou Shuurei, right?

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:29.610
I've seen you now and then at the Imperial Court.

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:33.030
Well, yes, I am.

00:17:33.480 --> 00:17:37.910
I was kinda told to take my best shot and propose marriage to you.

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:38.820
Huh?

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:42.950
A raccoon?

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:45.040
Here.

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:47.960
Well then.

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:57.380
Prime Minister Tei!

00:17:57.380 --> 00:17:58.630
Is His Highness here?!

00:17:58.630 --> 00:18:00.600
Um... well, no...

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:03.640
Your Highness, where art thou?!

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:07.640
The coast is clear.

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:16.070
I didn't say that I would never marry.

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:19.030
You must be in love with someone.

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:23.700
Your Highness, you have something you want, right?

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:32.340
I know it's extravagant, but its price went up before I knew it.

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:36.170
I'll do something about it.

00:18:36.560 --> 00:18:38.090
S-Something about it?

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:43.550
When my leg was injured by others,

00:18:43.550 --> 00:18:48.060
I felt that walking through life had become a little harder.

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:49.520
Injured by others?

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:56.150
I thought that the happiness others took for granted was not for me, and that I couldn't do anything about it.

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:58.490
But in the end,

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:04.030
even though I knew I should give up on it, I simply couldn't.

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:09.750
There are probably things that you find really precious and that are vital to you.

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:12.750
Just like trees and flowers need rain.

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:15.840
But I'm an Emperor.

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:19.760
And my job is to make your wishes come true.

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:21.880
Yuushun-dono.

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:29.310
I will say no to things you can't have, but I won't tell you to give up on things you can have.

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:31.770
Let's try in secret.

00:19:36.770 --> 00:19:40.280
Why on earth was that person holding a golden raccoon?

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:40.990
Who cares?

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:42.700
Why are you upset?

00:19:43.110 --> 00:19:44.410
I'm not upset.

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:49.000
It's about time for the water to be released.

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:57.040
Hey, you! What are you doing there, spacing out?!

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:04.090
Whoa! He's been swept away!

00:20:07.690 --> 00:20:09.430
Why was he sitting there?

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:12.390
He'll be caught by the net at the lower reaches.

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:14.060
Let's go to Kochou-san's place.

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:17.570
It feels like a lot of odd things are happening today.

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:39.020
The iris flower crest that I received from His Highness.

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:43.880
A badge given to those who swore absolute loyalty to the Emperor.

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:55.140
Shuuei!

00:20:56.980 --> 00:20:58.480
We're departing immediately!

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:01.780
Seiran, you should come too.

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:02.610
Yes.

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:09.370
Are you sure you should be doing this, Your Highness?

00:21:09.370 --> 00:21:10.410
What about your duties?

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:14.120
Yuushun-dono gave me permission to go, just for the afternoon.

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:17.500
It includes the task of finding Yuukoku-dono in the town.

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:18.880
Now I see.

00:21:19.280 --> 00:21:23.010
It's best if we go to Kougarou and get information from Kochou.

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:26.880
Shuurei-chan, welcome back.

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:28.090
Thanks.

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:31.140
Oh my, Santa's with you?

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:39.770
Kochou-nee-san, in your letter you said you wanted me to meet someone.

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:43.480
I want you to meet her, or rather, that person wants to meet you.

00:21:44.110 --> 00:21:48.200
Santa's business first. You wanted something from me?

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:52.990
Ah, yes. I wanted an expert opinion on a painting my uncle bought.

00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:55.790
Show me.

00:21:55.790 --> 00:21:56.370
Yes.

00:21:57.160 --> 00:21:58.210
It's this...

00:22:04.880 --> 00:22:06.010
It's a fake.

00:22:07.640 --> 00:22:10.710
It's skillful work. Even an art dealer might not be able to tell.

00:22:11.100 --> 00:22:12.050
A forgery?

00:22:13.100 --> 00:22:14.350
To tell you the truth, Shuurei-chan,

00:22:14.850 --> 00:22:19.940
just between us, for the last month or two, I've been seeing this sort of counterfeit on the market a lot.

00:22:21.230 --> 00:22:25.190
It's not on the black market either, which means the person behind the scenes is probably...

00:22:27.150 --> 00:22:27.990
A noble.

00:22:28.840 --> 00:22:32.450
Right. A considerable amount of money is going into his pocket.

00:22:32.830 --> 00:22:34.990
I wonder what he wants the money for?

00:22:36.410 --> 00:22:38.500
Santa, will you lend this to me for a while?

00:22:39.000 --> 00:22:41.210
Sure... but don't tell me you're gonna...

00:22:41.210 --> 00:22:43.170
I'm free to investigate what I want.

00:22:43.630 --> 00:22:46.670
Besides, your uncle would rather have his money back too, wouldn't he?

00:22:47.420 --> 00:22:48.050
Kochou!

00:22:50.380 --> 00:22:53.680
I thought you'd be late! It's unfair of you to keep her all to yourself!

00:22:54.140 --> 00:22:56.180
Oh, she had to come...

00:22:57.180 --> 00:22:58.850
Introduce me, quick!

00:23:00.640 --> 00:23:01.560
Yeah, yeah.

00:23:02.100 --> 00:23:04.570
She's the person I wanted you to meet.

00:23:04.570 --> 00:23:06.320
I've known her for a long time, but...

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:08.240
You must be Kou Shuurei-chan?

00:23:08.610 --> 00:23:09.610
Y-Yes!

00:24:44.960 --> 00:24:47.660
A stupid guy got swept away in the river?

00:24:48.250 --> 00:24:49.210
Well, that's really dumb.

00:24:49.670 --> 00:24:54.590
But if that fool has a golden raccoon, it means he's the idiot I met earlier?

00:24:54.980 --> 00:24:57.220
What business does he have with me?
